  "content": "{section: Intro}\n[G5]\n\n{section: Verso 1}\n[G5]I'm ahead, I'm a man\nI'm the first mammal to wear pants, yeah\nI'm at peace with my lust\nI can kill cause in God I trust, yeah\n[C7] [B7] [Bb7] [G5]It's evolution, baby\n\n{section: Verso 2}\n[G5]I'm at peace, I'm the man\nBuying stocks on the day of the crash\nOn the loose, I'm a truck\nAll the rolling hills, I'll flatten 'em out, yeah\n[C7] [B7] [Bb7] [G5]It's herd behavior, uh huh\n[C7] [B7] [Bb7] [G5]It's evolution, baby\n\n{section: Interlúdio}\n[Dsus2] [F] [Bb] [Dsus2]\n\n{section: Refrão}\n[Dsus2]Admire me, admire my [F]home\n[Bb]Admire my son, he's my [Dsus2]clone\nYeah, yeah, yeah, yeah\n[Dsus2]This land is mine, this land is [F]free\n[Bb]I'll do what I want but [Dsus2]irresponsibly\n[C7] [B7] [Bb7] [G5]It's evolution, baby\n\n{section: Ponte}\n[G5]I'm a thief, I'm a liar\nThere's my church, I sing in the choir:\n[D] [F] [E] [Gm]Hallelujah, hallelujah\n\n{section: Refrão}\n[Dsus2]Admire me, admire my [F]home\n[Bb]Admire my son, admire my [Dsus2]clones\n[Dsus2]'Cause we know, appetite for a nightly [F]feast\n[Bb]Those ignorant Indians got nothin' on [Dsus2]me\nNothin', why? Because...\n[C7] [B7] [Bb7]It's evolution, baby\n\n{section: Solo}\n[G5]Yeah\n\n{section: Verso 3}\n[G5]I am ahead, I am advanced\nI'm the first mammal to make plans, yeah\nI crawled the earth, but now I'm higher\n2010, watch it go to fire\n[C7] [B7] [Bb7]It's evolution, baby\n[G5] [C7] [B7] [Bb7]It's evolution, baby\n[G5]Ah\n\n{section: Outro}\n[C7] [B7] [Bb7] [G5]Do the evolution\n[G5]Come on, come on"
